|Name|Type|Description|
|---|---|---|
|s1|HANDLE|Handle to object.|
|s2|HANDLE|Handle to object.|

## Examples
#### VectorScript ####
```pascal
PROCEDURE AddSurfaceExample;
VAR
	h1, h2, h3 :HANDLE;
BEGIN
	DSelectAll;
	CallTool(-203);
	h1 := FSActLayer;
	DSelectAll;
	CallTool(-203);
