below is an example of a small VectorScript which displays a message in the message bar, then clears the message after
five seconds:

```pascal
PROCEDURE FirstExample;
CONST
   kGREETING = 'Hello ';
VAR
   MyMessage : STRING;
BEGIN
   myMessage:='Script';

